<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>New Post Pending Approval</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .content { background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; border-radius: 5px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #007bff; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; }
        .post-preview { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #007bff; margin: 15px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h2>New Post Pending Approval</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello Admin,</p>

        <p>A new post has been submitted and is waiting for your approval:</p>

        <div class="post-preview">
            <h3>{{ post.title }}</h3>
            <p><strong>Author:</strong> {{ post.author.email }}</p>
            <p><strong>Submitted:</strong> {{ post.createdAt|date('F j, Y \a\t g:i A') }}</p>
            <p><strong>Content Preview:</strong></p>
            <p>{{ post.content|slice(0, 200) }}{% if post.content|length > 200 %}...{% endif %}</p>
        </div>

        <p>Please review this post in the admin panel:</p>

        <a href="{{ adminUrl }}" class="btn">Review in Admin Panel</a>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <small>This is an automated notification from your blog system.</small>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
